  "description": "ABOUT THIS GAME\nThe daily-life horror series Tsugunohi, known for its simple “move left” gameplay, arrives on Nintendo Switch™ as\nTsugunohi -The Chamber of Phantom Name-!\nThe core gameplay remains the same: simply press the left key \"←\" to move the protagonist.\nWith no complex controls, you can fully immerse yourself in the eerie, realistic story crafted by ImCyan.\nIn this installment, you will wander between reality and illusion in a world both beautiful and bizarre.\nCan you endure an even more refined level of horror?\nExperience the evolved terror of Tsugunohi, brought to you by ImCyan.\n\nSTORY\nA young office worker, Kana Sakuragi, begins her new life in the renovated old house Akembara House.\nAt first glance, it seems like a perfect home, but each night, strange phenomena begin to occur.\nA suspicious manager, mysterious phantom character, and eerie origami—\nIs this reality… or something else?\n\nPROFILE\n■ Tsugunohi Series\nImCyan is an indie game creator who has continuously developed numerous horror titles.\nHis most notable work is the Tsugunohi series.\nThe defining feature of the Tsugunohi series is its unique horror experience.\nAs you repeatedly walk “to the left” along familiar routes such as your way home or workplace, everyday life gradually distorts, and a deep sense of fear begins to envelop you—\nPlease enjoy the unsettling horror of everyday life slowly turning ominous.",
